First you'll need to enter dependencies/ folder and type: make
That also fetches the prebuilt SWORD.xcframework and curl.xcframework
(iOS device and Apple silicon simulator, arm64, iOS 15.0) into
../cordova/cordova-plugin-crosswire-sword/libs/ios/

Then type make here to copy defs.h and flatapi.h into the plugin.

To rebuild the xcframeworks: dependencies/build-curl-ios.sh for curl
(on OpenSSL, verifying against the iOS trust store); for SWORD, target
SWORD of SWORD/SWORD.xcodeproj for iphoneos and iphonesimulator, then
xcodebuild -create-xcframework.  The README beside each download in
crosswire.org/ftpmirror/pub/sword/dependencies/apple/ gives the details.
